        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.15,
            0.578,
            0.644,
            0.616
          ],
          "content": "(iv) During a thunderstorm, it is safer to be in a car. [ ]"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.127,
            0.616,
            0.645,
            0.693
          ],
          "content": "3. Fig. 6.23 a shows a boy lying horizontally, and Fig. 6.23 b shows the boy standing vertically on a loose sand bed. In which case does the boy sink more in sand? Give reasons."
